exports[`the steps on their own > the mailbox form for gmail 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg> Back to providers</button></div><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Connect your mailbox</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Sign in to your mailbox. Imbox verifies credentials before saving.</p></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><label data-slot="label" class="flex items-center gap-2 font-medium select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Provider Preset</label><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5"><button type="button" class="rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 hover:text-foreground">Custom / Domain</button><button type="button" class="rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs transition-colors border-foreground bg-foreground text-background font-semibold">Gmail</button><button type="button" class="rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 hover:text-foreground">Fastmail</button><button type="button" class="rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 hover:text-foreground">iCloud</button><button type="button" class="rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 hover:text-foreground">Zoho Mail</button><button type="button" class="rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-border bg-card text-muted-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 hover:text-foreground">Migadu</button></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border/80 bg-muted/40 p-3.5 text-xs text-foreground space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info size-3.5 text-foreground shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><span>How to generate a Google App Password:</span></div><ol class="space-y-1.5 pl-5 list-decimal text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"><li><span>Make sure 2-Step Verification is turned ON in your Google Account. </span><a href="https://myaccount.google.com/security" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">Google Security <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></li><li><span>Create a 16-letter App Password for &#x27;Mail&#x27;. </span><a href="https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">Generate App