in="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-2 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 pt-2 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer">Skip mailbox setup &amp; customize appearance <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">You can connect additional mailboxes later anytime under Settings → Accounts.</p></div></div></div></div></div><p class="px-6 pb-6 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground">Private mail, on your own server.</p></div>"`;

